  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;※３　有形固定資産売却益の内容は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
